  "translation": "Last weekend, I went to the zoo with my friends. A few of us set out early in the morning, first taking the subway to the zoo. There were many animals in the zoo, very interesting. My favorite were the pandas, they were very cute. A friend asked me: 'Do you know what pandas eat?' I said: 'They eat bamboo.' At noon we had lunch at that restaurant. I ate a hamburger, my friend ate a bowl of noodles. We also drank beverages. In the afternoon we watched a dolphin show, and the dolphins could jump very high. We had a really great time that day. We made an appointment to come again next time."
